----------------------------------
1. JUnit Kya Hai?
----------------------------------

JUnit ek Java Testing Framework hai jisse hum apne code ko automatically test karte hain.

Purpose:
✔ Business logic sahi hai ya nahi.
✔ Future changes se bug aaya ya nahi.
✔ Manual testing ka time bachana.

Example:

public int add(int a, int b){
    return a+b;
}

JUnit Test

@Test
void testAdd(){
    assertEquals(5, calculator.add(2,3));
}

----------------------------------
2. Postman vs JUnit
----------------------------------

Postman
--------
• Manual Testing
• Spring Boot application run honi chahiye.
• API ko manually hit karte hain.
• Har baar request bhejni padti hai.

JUnit
------
• Automatic Testing
• Code automatically test hota hai.
• Ek click me 100 tests chal sakte hain.
• CI/CD me automatically run hota hai.

Example

Postman

POST /books

↓

Response dekho

↓

Database check karo


JUnit

Run Tests

↓

Pass/Fail instantly


