----------------------------------
4. Mockito Kyu Use Karte Hain?
----------------------------------

Problem

BookService

↓

Repository

↓

Database

Agar database down hai to test fail.

Lekin hume sirf Service test karni hai.

Solution

Mockito fake repository bana deta hai.

Example

@Mock
BookRepository repository;

when(repository.findById(1L))
.thenReturn(Optional.of(book));

Matlab

Agar id=1 maange

↓

Database mat jaana

↓

Ye book return kar dena.


